---- MODULE EnabledLevel ----
EXTENDS TLAPS
VARIABLE x
THEOREM Actions == ASSUME NEW ACTION B, NEW ACTION C, B <=> C PROVE ENABLED B <=> ENABLED C
  BY ENABLEDaxioms
THEOREM States == ASSUME NEW STATE P, NEW STATE Q, P <=> Q PROVE ENABLED P <=> ENABLED Q
  BY ENABLEDaxioms
THEOREM StateStep == ASSUME NEW STATE P, NEW STATE Q PROVE (P => Q) => (ENABLED P => ENABLED Q)
<1>1. ASSUME P => Q PROVE ENABLED P => ENABLED Q
  BY ENABLEDaxioms
<1> QED BY <1>1
THEOREM ActionStep == ASSUME NEW ACTION A, NEW ACTION B PROVE (A => B) => (ENABLED A => ENABLED B)
<1>1. ASSUME A => B PROVE ENABLED A => ENABLED B
  BY ENABLEDaxioms
<1> QED BY <1>1
====
